### host services
launchservices | open a folder through LaunchServices
  script: /usr/bin/open -g /System
  proof: fails with error -54 
  control: /usr/bin/pgrep -x Finder >/dev/null
apple events | send an Apple Event to Finder
  script: /usr/bin/osascript -e 'with timeout of 8 seconds' -e 'tell application "Finder" to count windows' -e 'end timeout'
  proof: apple event blocked: (-600)
  control: /usr/bin/pgrep -x Finder >/dev/null
launchd | submit a launchd job
  script: /bin/launchctl submit -l org.enclos.probe.7 -- /usr/bin/true
  proof: fails
  control: /bin/launchctl print gui/$(/usr/bin/id -u) >/dev/null 2>&1
  host: the launchd job org.enclos.probe.7
preferences | write preferences through cfprefsd
  script: /usr/bin/defaults write org.enclos.probe.7 probe -string written
  proof: fails
  control: /usr/bin/defaults domains >/dev/null 2>&1
  host: the preferences domain org.enclos.probe.7
launch agents | write in ~/Library/LaunchAgents
  script: echo x > '<dir>/user/Library/LaunchAgents/enclos-probe-7'
  proof: fails
  control: test -w '<dir>/user/Library/LaunchAgents'
  host: the file <dir>/user/Library/LaunchAgents/enclos-probe-7
### not here
1 of the 5 denied sensitive paths (they do not exist here)
denied paths that are neither a file nor a folder, which a probe could wait on: <dir>/user/work/pipe
renames and clones of 1 of the 3 folders that cannot move (they are not folders here)
